{"ticker":"FDXF","updated":"2026-11-13T23:28:58Z","profile":{"longName":"FedEx Freight Holding Company, Inc.","shortName":"FedEx Freight Holding Company, ","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","country":"United States","website":"https://www.fedexfreight.com","fullTimeEmployees":40000,"marketCap":20025380864,"trailingPE":39.275658,"forwardPE":26.005823,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.2769053,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":143.7857,"targetHighPrice":180.0,"targetLowPrice":108.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.081,"earningsGrowth":-0.497,"grossMargins":0.29278,"operatingMargins":0.0614,"profitMargins":0.07447,"totalRevenue":8794999808,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":200.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":103.48,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"FedEx Freight Holding Company, Inc. provides less-than-truckload freight transportation services in the United States and internationally. The company offers FedEx Freight Priority services, including next-business-day service for shipments traveling up to 600 miles and second-business-day service for shipments traveling up to 1,600 miles and backed by a money-back service guarantee if published delivery commitments are not met; and FedEx Freight Economy. It also provides surface expedite and white glove services; and LTL Select, a cloud-based transportation management system. In addition, the company offers volume and custom critical services, FedEx Freight Direct, and Retail Flex. It provides its services under the FedEx and FedEx Freight names. The company was incorporated in 2025 and is headquartered in Memphis, Tennessee.","summary_zh":"FedEx Freight Holding Company, Inc. 在美國和國際範圍內提供零擔貨運服務。該公司提供 FedEx Freight Priority 服務，包括為行程不超過 600 英里的貨件提供下一工作日服務，為行程不超過 1,600 英里的貨件提供第二個工作日服務，並在未達到公佈的交付承諾的情況下提供退款服務保證；和聯邦快遞貨運經濟。它還提供地面加急和白手套服務； LTL Select，一個基於雲端的運輸管理系統。此外，該公司還提供大量和客製化關鍵服務、FedEx Freight Direct 和 Retail Flex。它以 FedEx 和 FedEx Freight 名稱提供服務。該公司成立於 2025 年，總部位於田納西州孟菲斯。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"綜合貨運及物流","candles":[{"t":"2026-05-27","o":135.0,"h":159.9,"l":135.0,"c":151.0,"v":14200},{"t":"2026-05-28","o":158.1,"h":200.0,"l":158.1,"c":185.0,"v":6300},{"t":"2026-05-29","o":189.0,"h":199.5,"l":160.37,"c":160.37,"v":15400},{"t":"2026-06-01","o":164.0,"h":166.9,"l":141.33,"c":149.53,"v":7419200},{"t":"2026-06-02","o":150.01,"h":158.49,"l":149.11,"c":153.34,"v":4482500},{"t":"2026-06-03","o":152.3,"h":153.21,"l":145.01,"c":152.0,"v":4596400},{"t":"2026-06-04","o":150.66,"h":166.27,"l":150.66,"c":157.71,"v":2928400},{"t":"2026-06-05","o":157.48,"h":175.0,"l":157.48,"c":167.84,"v":2924900},{"t":"2026-06-08","o":167.02,"h":183.0,"l":166.13,"c":178.77,"v":1759900},{"t":"2026-06-09","o":178.12,"h":194.27,"l":178.12,"c":188.46,"v":2448900},{"t":"2026-06-10","o":175.5,"h":186.11,"l":169.99,"c":175.35,"v":2595700},{"t":"2026-06-11","o":177.0,"h":188.33,"l":177.0,"c":180.0,"v":1894500},{"t":"2026-06-12","o":180.54,"h":182.0,"l":168.11,"c":174.76,"v":1477800},{"t":"2026-06-15","o":173.91,"h":177.81,"l":166.04,"c":167.16,"v":1707700},{"t":"2026-06-16","o":162.1,"h":167.02,"l":160.02,"c":163.84,"v":1914300},{"t":"2026-06-17","o":163.9,"h":165.85,"l":157.8,"c":161.9,"v":2465500},{"t":"2026-06-18","o":165.0,"h":167.42,"l":160.1,"c":162.85,"v":3231500},{"t":"2026-06-22","o":165.45,"h":169.54,"l":160.08,"c":160.94,"v":2276200},{"t":"2026-06-23","o":162.0,"h":171.66,"l":161.0,"c":166.47,"v":1694400},{"t":"2026-06-24","o":169.0,"h":170.98,"l":157.96,"c":160.45,"v":1805800},{"t":"2026-06-25","o":161.02,"h":164.13,"l":157.75,"c":158.53,"v":1217500},{"t":"2026-06-26","o":155.36,"h":157.5,"l":144.27,"c":153.89,"v":6564800},{"t":"2026-06-29","o":152.49,"h":154.94,"l":147.46,"c":149.69,"v":1978200},{"t":"2026-06-30","o":149.84,"h":154.05,"l":145.49,"c":151.0,"v":2118500},{"t":"2026-07-01","o":151.0,"h":156.49,"l":148.33,"c":155.77,"v":2519600},{"t":"2026-07-02","o":155.68,"h":157.32,"l":149.31,"c":150.8